    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρί-εφθον</span></b> , τό,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυριάτη</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Philippid.
			10
		</span></i> (as cited by <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			6.54
		</span></i>, but <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πυριέφθας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					14.658d
				</span></i>
			 cod. A, and <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρὶ ἔφθαι</span>
				(sic)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">: τὸ πρῶτον γάλα</span>, and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυριεφθής</span> as 
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξηροπυρίτας</span>
			, 
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηροπυρίτας</span>
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.694
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.248
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1626.6
			</span></i> (ubi vulg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύρεφθον</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
